OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fstart to the night, with outbreaks of
OL,7,Fdrizzle possible. Clear spells develop
OL,8,Fby dawn, allowing some patchy frost to
OL,9,Fform in rural spots. A generally cold
OL,10,Ffeel to the night, with a brisk wind
OL,11,Falong coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FCloudy periods and sunny
OL,14,Fspells throughout the day. Most areas
OL,15,Fremaining dry, although the southeast
OL,16,Flikely seeing thicker and persistent
OL,17,Fcloud, with outbreaks of rain. Strong
OL,18,Fwind along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
